linear upload uploads a file and prints the Markdown snippet to paste.
-- file evidence]draft.txt --
private evidence
-- run --
linear upload 'evidence]draft.txt'
-- stdout --
evidence]draft.txt (0.0KB, text/plain, private)
  url: https://uploads.linear.app/0a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
  markdown: [evidence\]draft.txt](https://uploads.linear.app/0a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
-- state.json --
{"Upload": [{"filename": "evidence]draft.txt", "received": true, "sentAuthorization": false}]}
